                      "body": {
                        "message": "🚫 **PB-AUTO-01 RULE GATE FAILED**: relatedAnalyticRuleIds does not contain the required CD005 rule GUID (7c4e1a9d-3b6f-4e2a-b8c5-0d7f1e3a6b82) at @{utcNow()}. This playbook is scoped exclusively to CD005 incidents. No action taken."
